.TH LUPE 1 "2026-06-21" "lupe-cti 0.1.0" "Lupe CTI Manual"
.SH NAME
lupe \- Cyber Threat Intelligence CLI for OSINT & Forensics
.SH SYNOPSIS
.B lupe
.RI [ COMMAND ]
.RI [ OPTIONS ]
.RI [ ARGS ]
.br
.B lupe
.B enrich
.I IOC_VALUE
.RI [ OPTIONS ]
.br
.B lupe
.B misp
.B pull
.RI [ OPTIONS ]
.br
.B lupe
.B misp
.B push
.I IOC_VALUE
.RI [ OPTIONS ]
.SH DESCRIPTION
.B Lupe CTI
is a command-line tool for enriching Indicators of Compromise (IOCs)
using multiple threat intelligence sources in parallel. It supports
IP addresses, domains, URLs, file hashes, emails, phone numbers,
and usernames.
.SH COMMANDS
.TP
.B enrich
Enrich an IOC using multiple enrichment plugins.
.TP
.B bulk
Enrich multiple IOCs from a text file (one per line).
.TP
.B email-analyze
Analyze an .eml file for phishing indicators.
.TP
.B config show
Display current configuration (API keys masked).
.TP
.B config set
Set a configuration value in the .env file.
.TP
.B config test
Test connectivity to all configured APIs.
.TP
.B case new
Create a new investigation case.
.TP
.B case list
List investigation cases.
.TP
.B case show
Show case details including linked IOCs and timeline.
.TP
.B case close
Close an investigation case.
.TP
.B case add-note
Add an investigator note to a case.
.TP
.B misp pull
Pull IOCs from a MISP instance.
.TP
.B misp push
Push an analyzed IOC to MISP.
.TP
.B migrate-from-centinela
Migrate legacy Centinela database to Lupe CTI paths.
.SH OPTIONS
.TP
.B \-\-json
Output raw JSON instead of a formatted table.
.TP
.B \-\-no\-ai
Skip AI analysis via LLM provider.
.TP
.BI \-\-model " MODEL"
Override the LLM model for this run.
.TP
.BI \-\-case " ID"
Save results to database and link to this case ID.
.SH EXAMPLES
.TP
.B lupe enrich 8.8.8.8
Enrich an IPv4 address.
.TP
.B lupe enrich \-\-json example.com
Enrich a domain with JSON output.
.TP
.B lupe bulk iocs.txt \-\-case 1
Bulk enrich IOCs from file, linked to case 1.
.TP
.B lupe misp pull \-\-tag osint \-\-days 7
Pull IOCs from MISP tagged "osint" from last 7 days.
.TP
.B lupe misp push 8.8.8.8 \-\-tag lupe
Push an IP to MISP with the "lupe" tag.
.SH ENVIRONMENT
All settings use the
.B LUPE_
prefix:
.TP
.B LUPE_LLM_PROVIDER
LLM provider: ollama, openai, anthropic, openrouter (default: empty)
.TP
.B LUPE_OLLAMA_BASE_URL
Ollama server URL (default: http://localhost:11434)
.TP
.B LUPE_MISP_URL
MISP instance URL
.TP
.B LUPE_MISP_KEY
MISP API key
.SH SEE ALSO
.BR lupe\-desktop (1)
